    "created_at": "2021-10-08T07:57:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-08T07:58:19Z",
    "body": "> And also, I'm not sure Hello World should be quoted here. It's referring to the type of example as the actual output is \"Hello World!\". So I'd be inclined to close this.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in the description, this is currently inconsistent with another “Hello World” example, but would also violate [use/mention](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Use%E2%80%93mention_distinction). (That’s why this change seems to look like an improvement.)",
